('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000289', 'reading', 11, '{"passage": "Growing in your career often means planning a clear career path, taking part in professional development programs, and receiving honest feedback during your performance review. Before you even start a new role, you usually go through onboarding, which helps you learn the company culture.", "translation": "Crescer na carreira geralmente significa planejar uma trajetória de carreira clara, participar de programas de desenvolvimento profissional e receber feedback honesto durante sua avaliação de desempenho. Antes mesmo de começar uma nova função, você geralmente passa pela integração, que ajuda a aprender a cultura da empresa.", "question": "What helps you learn the company culture, according to the text?", "options": ["The performance review", "Onboarding", "The shortlist"], "correct_index": 1}'),
('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000289', 'listening', 12, '{"audio_text": "She got a promotion after two years. He has a clear career path in mind. My performance review is scheduled for next week.", "question": "When did she get a promotion, according to the audio?", "options": ["After one year", "After two years", "After five years"], "correct_index": 1}'),
